  "inline_comments": [
    {
      "body": "I don't think `single_numa_node` is needed. `intel_amx_benchmark` (and the other callers) could just compare the requested TP size with the existing `SGLANG_CPU_OMP_THREADS_BIND`. Only in case `SGLANG_CPU_OMP_THREADS_BIND` has 1 group and `tp_size > 1`, you need to build a new bind by splitting CPUs within this group.",
